# PWA Migration Toolkit - Gitignore Template
# Copy these patterns to your custom PWA project's .gitignore file
# to keep toolkit files out of your repository.
#
# Usage: cat .gitignore-toolkit-template >> .gitignore
#
# NOTE: This file (.gitignore-toolkit-template) is NOT meant to be copied.
#       Only its CONTENTS should be appended to your .gitignore file.
#
# Coverage: 41 toolkit files across 5 directories
#   - 9 instruction files (.github/instructions/)
#   - 3 skill files (.github/skills/)
#   - 25 script files (scripts/)
#   - 1 pattern database (data/)
#   - 2 guide files (docs/guides/)
#   - 1 verification script (scripts/)

# PWA Migration Toolkit (temporary helper files)
# ================================================
# These patterns ignore toolkit files while preserving your custom files

# Migration instructions
.github/instructions/migration-*.instructions.md

# PWA skills
.github/skills/pwa-*.SKILL.md
.github/skills/README.md

# Migration scripts
scripts/migrate-*.sh
scripts/migrate-*.js
scripts/check-*.sh
scripts/analyze-*.sh
scripts/detect-*.js
scripts/generate-*.sh
scripts/merge-*.sh
scripts/merge-*.js
scripts/compare-*.js
scripts/fix-*.js
scripts/sync-*.sh
scripts/update-*.sh
scripts/validate-*.sh
scripts/pre-commit-*.sh
scripts/verify-*.sh
scripts/migration-helper.js

# Pattern database
data/pattern-migrations.json

# Migration guides
docs/guides/migration-*.md
docs/guides/customization-*.md

# Migration reports (optional - comment out if you want to commit these)
migration-report-*.md
build-output*.log
icons-migration.md

# ================================================
# Verification: After adding these patterns, run:
#   git status --ignored | grep -E "(scripts|\.github|data)"
# 
# All toolkit files should appear as "ignored"
# Your custom app files should still appear as "untracked" or "modified"
